(text "E12 ADC driver prototype: remote raw-pin gain feedback, separate reference-half servos, low-voltage output rails." (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 6c9e7719-7f44-5a33-a3f0-7383b365318d))
(text "No PCB or bench validation. Actual converter loading, stability, full scale/noise, bias-rail windows and power faults require qualification." (at 20.32 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 3aec3d3e-4fc7-57eb-85cb-347b95d2ac56))
(text "THS4551 +/-outputs use V5_REG and per-channel LM7705 negative bias; no direct +/-12V output rail on raw ADC drivers." (at 20.32 596.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid ec69395a-e519-587f-8540-e07dfc8e1a87))
